 "name_en": "Money Market Mutual Fund Management (2UN)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Money Market Mutual Fund Management (2UN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item helps you to better manage your Money Market Mutual Fund instruments.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The Money Market Mutual Funds (MMMF) are traditionally traded at a stable 1.00 Currency Unit. An SEC rule in the U.S. for investment companies requires the MMMFs to declare their Net Asset Value (NAV) to be floating on a daily basis. This scope item incorporates the processes to manage both traditional and floating NAV MMMFs.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item covers the processes to create a securities class, and to purchase, bookkeep, and receive dividends of and sale of a money market mutual fund.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create security account and class</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create fund purchase transaction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set settlement status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create payment to depository bank</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Recognize dividend distribution</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Capitalize dividend distribution</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform period-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create fund redemption transaction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive payment from depository bank</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Review the status for money market mutual fund instruments easily</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support the management of Money Market Mutual Fund, including creation of security class, security accounts and the transactions, payments, recognize and capitalize dividend distribution, and so on</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make better operational and strategic decisions using the comprehensive reporting and analysis tools</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve internal operational compliance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>货币市场共同资金管理 (2UN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该范围项目可帮助您更好地管理货币市场共同资金工具。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">货币市场共同资金 (MMMF) 传统上以稳定的 1.00 货币单位进行交易。美国投资公司 SEC 规则要求 MMMF 声明其资产净值 (NAV) 每日浮动。此范围项目包含管理传统和浮动 NAV MMMF 的流程。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目涵盖创建证券类、购买、记账和接收货币市场共同基金的股息和销售的流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建证券账户和类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建资金采购交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">设置结算状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建到保管银行的付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确认股息分配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">资本化股息分配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行期末关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建资金偿还交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从保管银行接收付款</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio73deaf2225614931b1b54d9060c93c88__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松查看货币市场共同基金工具的状态。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持货币市场共同基金的管理，包括创建证券类、证券账户和交易、付款、确认和资本化股息分配等</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用全面的报表和分析工具，制定更明智的运营和战略决策</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高内部运营合规性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
